YangaCYBORG – Part 2 Testing

Testing Overview

The chatbot was tested to check that the graphical interface and main conversation features work correctly.

Test Input	Expected Result
Hello	Chatbot responds with a greeting
My name is Yanga	Chatbot recognises the user’s name
Tell me about phishing	Chatbot provides phishing information
I am worried	Chatbot responds supportively
I am interested in privacy	Chatbot remembers the preferred topic
What is my favorite topic?	Chatbot recalls privacy
Empty message	Chatbot asks the user to enter a message
Unrecognised message	Chatbot provides a fallback response

Testing Results

The main chatbot interactions were tested in the Windows Forms application. The chatbot responded to cybersecurity questions, recognised emotional expressions and recalled the user’s preferred topic.
